-- PermissionCatalogueIT asserts the Java constants and these rows agree in BOTH
-- directions, so a permission cannot be referenced in code without existing here,
-- and a row cannot linger here with nothing referencing it.
--
-- Least privilege is the design rule below. A permission being ABSENT from a role is
-- a decision, not an oversight: a teacher does not receive payroll, accounting,
-- health, discipline or counselling access by virtue of being a teacher, and the
-- officer who prepares payroll cannot approve it (spec 134, 158).
